main.py:

POST /api/shorten: creates a short code for a submitted URL
	→ call Backend.UrlShortener.create_short_code
		- checks whether a code already exists for the submitted URL:
			- if yes, returns the existing code
			- if no, continues processing
		- repeats generating a code until one that isn't already in use is found:
			→ call Backend.CodeGenerator.generate
				- generates a random 6-character alphanumeric code
			← return a candidate code
		- stores the code and URL in both lookup mappings
	← return the short code
	- responds with the short code as JSON

GET /{code}: redirects to the original URL for a short code
	→ call Backend.UrlShortener.get_url
		- looks up the original URL for the submitted short code
	← return the original URL, or nothing if not found
	- checks whether a URL was found:
		- if no, responds not found
		- if yes, redirects to the original URL
